  m_text: "Controls: \r\n\r\nA and D to move left to right\r\n\r\nleft click to use
    player ability to slow enemies\r\n\r\nright click to use the hero favors you
    get at the specific ledges that look like they are a hole in the wall\n\nEscape
    to pause the game"
